proposed_comments.body:
After a confirmed bulk delete, `IsSelectionMode = false` flips the bound lists back to `SelectionMode.None` while they can still contain selected items. The toggle path already clears while the lists are still in `Multiple` mode because `SelectedItems` is invalid otherwise; the delete path needs the same ordering to avoid crashing the settings panel.

**Severity:** `high`

```suggestion
            ClearAllSelections();
            IsSelectionMode = false;
```

